<title>CHINA: HK exchange lists temporarily suspended firms.</title>
<headline>HK exchange lists temporarily suspended firms.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong stock exchange gave a &quot;Temporary Suspension Status Report&quot; on Monday on four companies suspended due to enquiries by the Securities and Futures Commission into unusual trading movement.</p>
<p>The suspended companies are Hansom Holdings Ltd, Singapore Hong Kong Properties Investment Ltd, Leung Kee Holdings Ltd and Cheong Ming Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Trading in shares of the four companies remained suspended on Monday pending announcements.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
